  "_digests_comment": [
    "sha256 of every ported file, as the last sync wrote it. tools/sync-dial.py",
    "--check compares the tree against these, which is how the build answers",
    "'has anyone hand-edited the dial?' without reaching for a second repository.",
    "",
    "BASELINE, NOT A REGENERATION. meltface-80/dial-for-Roon is gone, so these",
    "could not be produced by re-running the sync. They are the bytes already in",
    "this tree at commit 36f5a60 \u2014 the last commit whose CI run did the full",
    "upstream comparison and passed, on 15 September 2026. No ported file has",
    "changed since. Anything written by a real --write from a real --source",
    "replaces them, and agrees with them if that source is the pinned commit."
  ],
